cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its measurements, please cite it as below."
title: "smem: self-hosted long-term memory for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A local agent-memory service with a Supermemory-shaped API. It extracts
  atomic facts from documents with a small local LLM, reconciles them over
  time (duplicate, update or distinct, with full version history), retrieves
  facts and source chunks through a bi-encoder plus cross-encoder pipeline,
  and builds a typed memory graph and profile in the background. All model
  stages run on llama.cpp servers, distributed across one or more machines.
  Includes measurements: 98.83% context reduction at full recall on a
  105k-token corpus, and a record of silent failure modes in LLM-based
  memory pipelines.
type: software
